&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in high-growth companies scaling enterprise go-to-market&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;A track record of building product marketing functions or teams&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience in highly competitive markets requiring sharp differentiation&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Background marketing AI/ML products or developer tools to enterprise buyers&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Experience working closely with sales teams on strategic, technical deals&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
