cncf-landscape-new-relic:greenhouse:5237.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We are a global team of innovators and pioneers dedicated to shaping the future of observability. At New Relic, we build an intelligent platform that empowers companies to thrive in an AI-first world by giving them unparalleled insight into their complex systems. As we continue to expand our global footprint, we&#39;re looking for passionate people to join our mission. If you&#39;re ready to help the world&#39;s best companies optimize their digital applications, we invite you to explore a career with us!&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description Senior Data Scientist (P3)&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Location : Bangalore&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience : 5 - 8 years&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About New Relic&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;New Relic is a cloud-based observability platform that gives developers, engineers, operations, and management a clear view of what’s happening in today’s complex software environments. So they can find and fix problems faster, and deliver delightful experiences for their customers. That&#39;s why the world’s best engineering teams rely on New Relic to visualize, analyze, and troubleshoot their software. It’s the simplest, most powerful cloud-based observability platform, built to create more perfect software. All from one place.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Founded in 2008, we’re a global company passionate about building a culture where all employees feel a deep sense of belonging, where every ‘Relic’ can bring their whole self to work and feel supported and empowered to thrive. We’re consistently recognized as a distinguished employer and are committed to building world-class products and an award-winning culture. For more information, visit newrelic.com.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h2&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description: Senior Data Scientist&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why This Role Matters:&lt;/strong&gt; Most GenAI roles right now are drowning in hype, focusing purely on prompt engineering with little mathematical substance. On the flip side, many traditional data science roles are stuck in silos, far away from production. &lt;strong&gt;This role is the antidote to both.&lt;/strong&gt; At New Relic, you will sit at the intersection of massive-scale telemetry data and cutting-edge intelligence. You will use your deep statistical foundations to solve complex, real-world time-series and anomaly detection problems, while simultaneously having the mandate to build the next generation of AI Agents and LLM orchestration for autonomous observability. You won&#39;t just build models in a vacuum—you will deploy them, own them, and see their impact on millions of applications globally.&lt;strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are seeking an experienced and dynamic Senior Data Scientist to join our team at New Relic. You will be primarily responsible for driving data-oriented projects, transforming ambiguous business problems into clear, actionable insights, and productionalizing those insights at scale. The ideal candidate is adept at understanding business needs that are often quantitatively ambiguous and using large, complex, structured datasets (such as telemetry, time-series, and system logs) to find opportunities for product and process optimization. You should be able to work independently, take an idea and run with it, and deliver high-impact results while bridging the gap between classical ML modeling and the next wave of agentic AI.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Responsibilities&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Predictive Analytics:&lt;/strong&gt; Analyze large, complex structured datasets, applying robust statistical methods and classical machine learning techniques (e.g., time-series forecasting, anomaly detection, classification, and linear/logistic regression).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Model Deployment:&lt;/strong&gt; End-to-end ownership of data science solutions, including building, evaluating, and deploying models into production with clean version control and CI/CD practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Rigorous Evaluation:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish and manage model evaluation frameworks to track model accuracy, data drift, and performance metrics post-deployment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GenAI Exploration:&lt;/strong&gt; Collaborate on innovative initiatives by building AI Agents and exploring LLM orchestration to advance autonomous observability capabilities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Cross-Functional Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner effectively with internal stakeholders, engineering teams, and product managers to understand technical needs and translate data findings into actionable product plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Communication &amp;amp; Visualization:&lt;/strong&gt; Present complex analytical findings using data visualization techniques, clearly communicating recommendations to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Required Qualifications&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; 5+ years of professional experience as a Data Scientist or in a highly quantitative technical role.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Education:&lt;/strong&gt; Bachelor’s degree or more.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Statistical Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; Strong foundational understanding and practical application of advanced statistical concepts, classical machine learning algorithms ,Deep Learning and time-series analysis.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Technical Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; Expert-level skills in &lt;strong&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; and &lt;strong&gt;SQL&lt;/strong&gt; for data manipulation, modeling, and pipeline development.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Production Experience:&lt;/strong&gt; Proven track record of taking data science models out of notebooks and successfully deploying them into a live production environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Soft Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Exceptional problem-solving abilities, should be comfortable navigating ambiguity, good communication skills, and the ability to manage multiple competing priorities independently with minimal supervision.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Stakeholder Management:&lt;/strong&gt; Prior experience translating complex data science methodologies into clear, high-impact narratives for leadership and non-technical audiences.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Good to Have&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Domain Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Experience in the &lt;strong&gt;Observability&lt;/strong&gt;, APM (Application Performance Monitoring), or AIOps space, particularly working with large-scale telemetry data (metrics, events, logs, and traces).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;GenAI Exposure:&lt;/strong&gt; Hands-on experience or deep familiarity with LLM orchestration frameworks (e.g., LangChain, LlamaIndex, CrewAI) and building practical AI Agents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Modern MLOps:&lt;/strong&gt; Exposure to advanced deployment infrastructure like &lt;strong&gt;Docker&lt;/strong&gt;, &lt;strong&gt;Kubernetes&lt;/strong&gt;, and scaling PODs in cloud environments.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Pillars to Highlight to Candidates&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We can emphasize these three things:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Real Data at Massive Scale:&lt;/strong&gt; You aren&#39;t working on boring, clean tabular data. You are tackling high-velocity, complex telemetry data where your statistical rigor actually matters.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;The Best of Both Worlds:&lt;/strong&gt; You don&#39;t have to choose between keeping your classical ML skills sharp and learning GenAI. We want you to use your strong math background &lt;em&gt;and&lt;/em&gt; give you the playground to build AI agents.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;True End-to-End Ownership:&lt;/strong&gt; You won&#39;t just hand code over to an engineering team to die in a queue. You’ll have the autonomy to build, evaluate, and push your models to production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;content-conclusion&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Fostering a diverse, welcoming and inclusive environment is important to us. We work hard to make everyone feel comfortable bringing their best, most authentic selves to work every day. We celebrate our talented Relics’ different backgrounds and abilities, and recognize the different paths they took to reach us – including nontraditional ones. Their experiences and perspectives inspire us to make our products and company the best they can be. We’re looking for people who feel connected to our mission and values, not just candidates who check off all the boxes.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;If you require a reasonable accommodation to complete any part of the application or recruiting process, please reach out to &lt;a href=&quot;mailto:resume@newrelic.com&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;resume@newrelic.com&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We believe in empowering all Relics to achieve professional and business success through a flexible workforce model. This model allows us to work in a variety of workplaces that best support our success, including fully office-based, fully remote, or hybrid.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Our hiring process&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;In compliance with applicable law, all persons hired will be required to verify identity and eligibility to work and to complete employment eligibility verification. Note: Our stewardship of the data of thousands of customers means that a criminal background check is required to join New Relic.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;We will consider qualified applicants with arrest and conviction records based on individual circumstances and in accordance with applicable law including, but not limited to, the&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://sfgov.org/olse/sites/default/files/FCO%20poster2020.pdf&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;San Francisco Fair Chance Ordinance&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Headhunters and recruitment agencies may not submit resumes/CVs through this website or directly to managers. New Relic does not accept unsolicited headhunter and agency resumes, and will not pay fees to any third-party agency or company that does not have a signed agreement with New Relic.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;New Relic develops and distributes encryption software and technology that complies with U.S. export controls and licensing requirements. Certain New Relic roles require candidates to pass an export compliance assessment as a condition of employment in any global location. If relevant, we will provide more information later in the application process.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Candidates are evaluated based on qualifications, regardless of race, religion, ethnicity, national origin, sex, sexual orientation, gender expression or identity, age, disability, neurodiversity, veteran or marital status, political viewpoint, or other legally protected characteristics.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Review our Applicant Privacy Notice at&amp;nbsp;&lt;a href=&quot;https://newrelic.com/termsandconditions/applicant-privacy-policy&quot; target=&quot;_blank&quot;&gt;https://newrelic.com/termsandconditions/applicant-privacy-policy&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;

cncf-landscape-pure-storage:greenhouse:7.descriptionHtml:
&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;We’re in an unbelievably exciting area of tech and are fundamentally reshaping the data storage industry. Here, you lead with innovative thinking, grow along with us, and join the smartest team in the industry.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As a &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;5&quot;&gt;Software Systems Architect&lt;/strong&gt;, you will serve as the technical visionary and bridge between complex global business needs and high-quality technical execution. Based in our Prague R&amp;amp;D, you will define the architectural roadmap for engineering teams across Prague and Santa Clara, transforming requirements from Sales, Marketing, HR, and Customer Service into scalable, AWS-native solutions. Your mission is to elevate our engineering standards by architecting cutting-edge&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;475&quot;&gt;Agentic systems&lt;/strong&gt; and intelligent orchestration layers. This is a high-impact leadership role where you will drive innovation, mentor a growing organization of 30+ developers, and ensure our internal platforms are resilient, secure, and future-proof.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Architectural Governance &amp;amp; Design:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the end-to-end design of complex, distributed systems by creating high-fidelity blueprints that align technical strategy with internal business goals for scalability and maintainability.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Hands-on Technical Leadership:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive &quot;lead-by-example&quot; execution by building Proof of Concepts (POCs), conducting live technical demonstrations, and authoring the gold-standard design documentation that sets the bar for the entire engineering organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Systemic Quality Assurance:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the final authority on technical designs, rigorously reviewing architectural proposals to mitigate risks in performance, reliability, and security before they reach production.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Agentic Systems Innovation:&lt;/strong&gt; Drive the adoption of Agentic services and prediction models, architecting the orchestration layers that enable AI agents to solve intricate business problems for global stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Technical Mentorship &amp;amp; Culture:&lt;/strong&gt; Actively coach a community of 30+ developers to improve the collective mastery of design-led development, advanced unit/functional testing practices, and modern coding standards.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Strategic Collaboration:&lt;/strong&gt; Partner closely with the Head of Engineering in Santa Clara to translate high-level global roadmaps into actionable technical strategies, ensuring seamless execution across geographic boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,6,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,6,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Operational Excellence:&lt;/strong&gt; Standardize the integration of complex data environments, ensuring that our architectural patterns support robust data engineering and AI-driven workflows at scale.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Software Engineering Mastery:&lt;/strong&gt; 10+ years of professional experience in software development and architecture, including&amp;nbsp; hands-on coding skills in &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;158&quot;&gt;Python&lt;/strong&gt; (preferred) or Java.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Technical Influence:&lt;/strong&gt; A proven &quot;Architect-Coder&quot; mindset with the ability to influence engineering culture through technical excellence, high-quality documentation, and a &quot;quality-first&quot; approach to testing.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Cloud Architecture Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Deep, hands-on experience architecting resilient microservices and distributed systems within &lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;124&quot;&gt;AWS&lt;/strong&gt; (specifically utilizing SQS, SNS, and SageMaker).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;9,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Agentic AI Proficiency:&lt;/strong&gt; A sophisticated understanding of Agentic AI architecture, including multi-agent orchestration, LLM-powered tool calling, and the integration of prediction models into business workflows.&lt;/li&gt;
