&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;THE ROLE&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;As a &lt;strong&gt;Senior Test Engineer, Service Logistics&lt;/strong&gt;, you will own the critical intersection of test engineering and hardware repair operations to ensure our returned enterprise storage systems are perfectly requalified. You will safeguard the quality of the Everpure Platform by developing, deploying, and sustaining robust test solutions that eliminate test escapes and maximize asset recovery. Partnering closely with Service Logistics, Quality, and Hardware Engineering, you will turn data-driven failure analysis into systemic operational improvements at our repair centers. This is your opportunity to directly protect customer satisfaction and optimize global supply chain efficiency for a world-class technology infrastructure.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;1&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;3&quot;&gt;WHAT YOU&#39;LL DO&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Own Test Code Infrastructure and Readiness:&lt;/strong&gt; Develop, port, and maintain automated Python test scripts to ensure all returned enterprise storage controllers are flawlessly diagnosed, while leading the seamless transition of test code and engineering readiness for new product introductions at our global repair sites.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Drive Operational Quality and Optimization:&lt;/strong&gt; Establish standardized procedures and strict test flow sequencing with repair center technicians to isolate hardware failures, eliminate test escapes, and systematically reduce material waste.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Lead Cross-Functional Engineering Alignment:&lt;/strong&gt; Act as the primary technical bridge and voice of test engineering between Service Logistics, Hardware Design, Quality, and third-party vendor operations to resolve complex test discrepancies and realign diagnostic logic.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;4,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Execute Data-Driven Failure and Performance Analysis:&lt;/strong&gt; Mine and analyze large operational datasets to generate precise repair disposition metrics, mapping root-cause trends to provide actionable feedback that continuously updates and improves hardware failure categorization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;h4 data-path-to-node=&quot;6&quot;&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Experience&lt;/strong&gt;: 3+ years of experience in&amp;nbsp;&lt;strong&gt;manufacturing test, repair operations, or service logistics&lt;/strong&gt;, preferably with enterprise storage or server hardware.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,0,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Hardware Test &amp;amp; Diagnosis Expertise:&lt;/strong&gt; Advanced capability in system-level hardware debugging and a proven background in manufacturing test environments, server/enterprise storage hardware architecture, or electronics repair operations.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,1,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Collaborative Automation Programming:&lt;/strong&gt; Proficiency in writing, debugging, and maintaining test automation code using Python within a collaborative, Git-based version control workflow.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;7,2,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Operational Analytical Skills:&lt;/strong&gt; Mastery in manipulating large operational or hardware datasets to draw clear, root-cause conclusions and present technical findings clearly to cross-functional engineering and supply chain leadership.&lt;/li&gt;
