&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,3,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Enable Business Growth:&lt;/strong&gt; Provide strategic indirect tax guidance on new product launches, international invoicing flows, and system modifications to ensure seamless compliance from day one.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,4,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Manage Audit &amp;amp; Authority Relations:&lt;/strong&gt; Lead the preparation of documentation and technical responses for indirect tax audits and customs queries, effectively mitigating potential financial exposure.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li data-path-to-node=&quot;6,5,0&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;6,5,0&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;Oversee Fiscal Health &amp;amp; Governance:&lt;/strong&gt; Maintain and optimize global compliance calendars, tracking filing deadlines, tax payments, and outstanding balances to ensure zero operational disruptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot;&gt;&lt;strong data-path-to-node=&quot;8&quot; data-index-in-node=&quot;0&quot;&gt;WHAT YOU BRING&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
