&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Vestmark Advisory Solutions (VAS) is expanding its advisory and asset management services and has an opening for an experienced individual in the retail SMA order generation and trade execution arena. The VAS Trader is primarily responsible for implementing trades to Manager Models. The models are proprietary and 3rd party. This position supports SMA, MSP, and Model Only/UMA sponsors and managers and maintaining the underlying accounts. In addition, this role handles trade order management, pre- and post-trade&amp;nbsp;servicing, and ensuring trades are submitted and executed.&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
