&lt;div class=&quot;iCIMS_Expandable_Text&quot; style=&quot;text-align: center;&quot;&gt;BAYADA Home Health Care has a full, part or prn position for a Certified Occupational Therapy Assistant (COTA) to provide visits for our Davidson County Visits office located in Thomasville, NC. This position works with our adult and geriatric clients in homes throughout Chatham and Lee counties in North Carolina.&lt;/div&gt;
