&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Speech Language Pathologist (SLP), Early Intervention &amp;amp; Pediatrics&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Delaware | Flexible Schedule | Up to $75 per Visit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Come for the Flexibility. Stay for the Impact.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At BAYADA, we believe therapists deserve more than just a job, they deserve support, flexibility, and the opportunity to truly make a difference. As a nonprofit organization, our focus is always on what matters most: delivering exceptional care to children and empowering families.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We are currently seeking passionate Per Diem or Part Time&lt;strong&gt; Speech Language Pathologists (SLP)&lt;/strong&gt; to join our Early Intervention and Pediatric team in Delaware.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why SLPs Choose BAYADA&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Flexibility That Fits Your Life&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set your own schedule based on your availability&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Choose your geographic coverage area&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Part-Time (25+ visits/week), Per Diem (5 visits/week)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Compensation &amp;amp; Benefits&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Up to $75 per visit&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Weekly pay&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Travel stipend&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;PTO&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;401(k) with company match&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Medical, Dental &amp;amp; Vision insurance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Employee Assistance Program&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Unmatched Clinical Support&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Dedicated office team supporting you in the field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Paid orientation&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Comprehensive onboarding &amp;amp; professional development&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Bi-annual continuing education reimbursement&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;24/7 clinical support&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Collaborative team of experienced clinicians&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What You’ll Do&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;As an Early Intervention SLP, you will:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with families using a coaching-based interaction style&lt;/li&gt;
