&lt;li&gt;Active Delaware or multistate Speech Language Pathologist license in good standing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Birth-to-Five, and/or Home Care experience preferred&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Passion for family-centered, community-based care&lt;/li&gt;
